    {
      "id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0005",
      "source_line": 6,
      "source_atom": "# label-foreign-text v0.1｜外文與跨國標示審查｜2026-11-08",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0005"
    },
    {
      "id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0006",
      "source_line": 8,
      "source_atom": "來源：MIKO 2026-11-06 提出的「外文與跨國標示規則（提案）」5 條，總召審查後改寫（ADR-057；MIKO 2026-11-08 選 B 案：miko-core 一句通則＋本 Skill）。先載入 miko-core；與 miko-core §4 研究與查核細則、§7 硬邊界重疊處以 miko-core 為準。",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0006"
    },
    {
      "id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0007",
      "source_line": 10,
      "source_atom": "- 負責什麼：包材、標籤、說明書上的他國文字審查與排版建議（一個 Skill 只做這件事）。不處理一般翻譯、施工查驗照片（photo-inspection-log；該 Skill「字形相同就照寫」只適用白板中文與既有詞庫，不適用本 Skill）。",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0007"
    },
    {
      "id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0008",
      "source_line": 11,
      "source_atom": "- 看哪些資料：MIKO 提供的標籤稿或照片（版本或日期）、目標國家、產品類別；該國主管機關的法規或公告原文。",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0008"
    },
    {
      "id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0009",
      "source_line": 12,
      "source_atom": "- 連接器：網頁搜尋與網頁讀取。排程：無。",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0009"
    },
    {
      "id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0010",
      "source_line": 13,
      "source_atom": "- 交回什麼：逐字串判定表（字串、字義、官方用語、分類、配對對象、來源與日期一行）＋版面方案（至少兩案）＋待核對清單＋任務四態。",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0010"
    },
    {
      "id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0011",
      "source_line": 14,
      "source_atom": "- 先問 MIKO：目標國家、產品類別、哪一版是要審的標籤稿；稿件含公司名、產品名、批號時只在對話內處理，不寫進任何公開檔。",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0011"
    },
    {
      "id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0012",
      "source_line": 15,
      "source_atom": "- 高風險：藥品、醫療器材、食品、化學品的標示定稿前走 independent-audit（miko-core §6「不自審」條：高風險定案前用 independent-audit；醫療屬高風險，食品、化學品是本 Skill 自加的高風險類別）。",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0012"
    },
    {
      "id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0013",
      "source_line": 17,
      "source_atom": "## 1. 問問題",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0013"
    },
    {
      "id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0014",
      "source_line": 18,
      "source_atom": "- 必問：目標國家；產品類別；標籤稿版本。沒給目標國家就停在這裡，不從文字猜國家（同一種文字可能用在多國）。",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0014"
    },
    {
      "id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0015",
      "source_line": 19,
      "source_atom": "- 預設值：沒說要定稿時，產出標「草案」；沒說可否改字時，只建議、不改原稿字串。",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0015"
    },
    {
      "id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0016",
      "source_line": 21,
      "source_atom": "## 2. 解決（有先後依賴，依序做；前一步沒完成不跳到後面）",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0016"
    },
    {
      "id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0017",
      "source_line": 22,
      "source_atom": "1. 字義與官方用語",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0017"
    },
    {
      "id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0018",
      "source_line": 23,
      "source_atom": "   - 輸入：標籤上每一個外文字串（逐字抄出，含聲調符號）、目標國家。",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0018"
    },
    {
      "id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0019",
      "source_line": 24,
      "source_atom": "   - 輸出：每字串的字義、該國法規或主管機關使用的用語、來源與日期一行（「發布：YYYY-MM-DD｜生效：YYYY-MM-DD｜查閱：YYYY-MM-DD」，缺的寫 UNKNOWN）。",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0019"
    },
    {
      "id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0020",
      "source_line": 25,
      "source_atom": "   - 閘門：只靠字形辨識或模型記憶不算查證，不得往下。特定官方來源讀不到時，先換一次替代來源（例如法規資料庫讀不到改主管機關公告頁或官方公報），仍讀不到依 miko-core §2.7 標 NOT_READ；換查法後仍找不到字義或官方用語寫「未證實」，並分開寫是工具失敗、沒有資料或無權限（miko-core §4 研究與查核）。標 NOT_READ 或「未證實」的字串，第 2～5 步停，其他字串照做。",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0020"
    },
    {
      "id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0021",
      "source_line": 26,
      "source_atom": "2. 分類",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0021"
    },
    {
      "id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0022",
      "source_line": 27,
      "source_atom": "   - 輸入：第 1 步結果。",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0022"
    },
    {
      "id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0023",
      "source_line": 28,
      "source_atom": "   - 輸出：每字串標「法定標示用語」（法規要求出現的字樣，例如到期日、製造日、批號的標題字，依該國法規而定）或「一般翻譯」。",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0023"
    },
    {
      "id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0024",
      "source_line": 29,
      "source_atom": "   - 閘門：分不出來標 UNKNOWN，當法定標示用語處理（較保守），並列入待核對清單。",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0024"
    },
    {
      "id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0025",
      "source_line": 30,
      "source_atom": "3. 配對",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0025"
    },
    {
      "id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0026",
      "source_line": 31,
      "source_atom": "   - 輸入：第 2 步的法定標示用語。",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0026"
    },
    {
      "id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0027",
      "source_line": 32,
      "source_atom": "   - 輸出：每個法定用語對應的資料（例如到期日數字）與配對關係。",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0027"
    },
    {
      "id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0028",
      "source_line": 33,
      "source_atom": "   - 閘門：預設相鄰並配對（這是 MIKO 的版面預設，不是法規斷言），不得為了版面把法定用語挪到和對應資料無關的位置；實際位置與格式要求以該國原法條為準。只讀到二手來源時寫「原法條 NOT_READ（依據：二手來源名稱）」並附日期一行，方案標「暫定」，不當定稿依據。",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0028"
    },
    {
      "id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0029",
      "source_line": 34,
      "source_atom": "4. 版面",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0029"
    },
    {
      "id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0030",
      "source_line": 35,
      "source_atom": "   - 輸入：第 2、3 步結果與標籤尺寸或稿件。",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0030"
    },
    {
      "id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0031",
      "source_line": 36,
      "source_atom": "   - 輸出：衝突原因逐類判定（法規、配對、可讀性、固定物理位置，各寫是或否與依據），再給至少兩個方案，每案照 miko-core §2.8 列做法、代價、主要風險、可逆性、怎麼驗收，另加是否仍相鄰並配對；選一案並寫不採其他案的理由。",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "LABEL-FOREIGN-TEXT-0031"
    },
