      "source_line": 37,
      "source_atom": "   - 閘門：不得只寫「放不下」；四類原因有任一類是 UNKNOWN 時，方案標「暫定」並寫要補查哪一類。",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
